<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28505" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mĕlĭta</span></b> , ae, or
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mĕlĭtē</span></b> ,
		ēs, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μελίτη</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>The isle of Malta</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 4, 46, § 103</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				3, 8, 14, § 92</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>An island off the coast of Dalmatia</i>, now <i>Meleda</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 26,
				30, § 152</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. F. 3,
				567</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A city of Ionia</i>, <i><span class="en">Vitr. 4,
			1</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>A city of Cappadocia</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 6, 3, 3,
				§ 8</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>V.</b>
			<i>A seanymph</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 5,
				825</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
